{"title": "Exotic Material", "pageid": 30414, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Exotic_Material", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Exotic Material</b> is a passive feature that makes the armor more flexible, and prevents stealth penalties.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Add your full Dexterity <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Modifier\">Modifier</a> to your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a>. Additionally, this armour does not impose <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on Stealth <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Checks</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Agility\" title=\"Armour of Agility\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Armour_of_Agility_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Armour_of_Agility_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Armour_of_Agility_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Armour_of_Agility_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Armour_of_Agility_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Armour_of_Agility_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Armour_of_Agility_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Armour_of_Agility_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Armour_of_Agility_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Agility\" title=\"Armour of Agility\">Armour of Agility</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sharpened_Snare_Cuirass\" title=\"Sharpened Snare Cuirass\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sharpened_Snare_Cuirass\" title=\"Sharpened Snare Cuirass\">Sharpened Snare Cuirass</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unwanted_Masterwork_Scalemail\" title=\"Unwanted Masterwork Scalemail\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Unwanted_Masterwork_Scalemail_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Unwanted_Masterwork_Scalemail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Unwanted_Masterwork_Scalemail_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Unwanted_Masterwork_Scalemail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Unwanted_Masterwork_Scalemail_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Unwanted_Masterwork_Scalemail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Unwanted_Masterwork_Scalemail_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Unwanted_Masterwork_Scalemail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Unwanted_Masterwork_Scalemail_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Unwanted_Masterwork_Scalemail\" title=\"Unwanted Masterwork Scalemail\">Unwanted Masterwork Scalemail</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yuan-Ti_Scale_Mail\" title=\"Yuan-Ti Scale Mail\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Scale_Mail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scale_Mail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Scale_Mail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Scale_Mail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Scale_Mail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Scale_Mail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Scale_Mail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scale_Mail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Scale_Mail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Yuan-Ti_Scale_Mail\" title=\"Yuan-Ti Scale Mail\">Yuan-Ti Scale Mail</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><b>Exotic Material</b> does not work if either the <a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour_Master\" title=\"Medium Armour Master\">Medium Armour Master</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Cleric\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Cleric\">Magic Initiate: Cleric</a> feat is gained. The Magic Initiate: Cleric feat has an unlisted effect that increases the maximum AC bonus from Dexterity while wearing Medium Armour from +2 to +3.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201225\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nCo